# Lesson 3: First Words
# A child combines sounds. Not spelling — sounds.
# muh + ah + muh is how "mama" sounds when you say it.
# The child doesn't know letters yet. They know sounds.

# --- Sounds combine into words ---
muh + ah + muh = mama
duh + ah + duh = dada
kuh + ah + tuh = cat
duh + oh + guh = dog
buh + ah + luh = ball
kuh + uh + puh = cup
ruh + eh + duh = red
buh + ih + guh = big
huh + oh + tuh = hot
guh + oh = go
uh + puh = up
nuh + oh = no
yuh + eh + suh = yes
huh + eye = hi
